<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo adds 500 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo adds 500 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 2.0 billion marks from 1.5 billion marks, joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Bank and HypoBank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG AG</p>
<p> AMT   *2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    02.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.95     PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    HAM	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINAL LAUNCHED 15.JAN.97 AND INCREASED 13.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.19	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 964</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
